{"id":"m6-503","m":6,"paper":"河南省2019年统一考试录用司法所公务员《行测》题（网友回忆版）","region":"河南","year":2019,"q":15,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":"<p>        2018年1-2月份，全国规模以上工业企业实现利润总额9689亿元，同比增长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7bbe4b7a171a99e5.png\" />。其中，国有控股企业实现利润总额2918.1亿元，同比增长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0aa1ea91b62947ea.png\" />；集体企业实现利润总额36.9亿元，增长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fddd29d7660dcac9.png\" />；股份制企业实现利润总额6829.5亿元，增长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c56b990164598be8.png\" />；外商及港澳台商投资企业实现利润总额2259.6亿元，增长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a8c8f28c84d82b38.png\" />；私营企业实现利润总额2830.8亿元，增长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f74801b8674b37ff.png\" />。按行业分其中采矿业实现利润总额877.9亿元，同比增长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3b60def15b0ca7fa.png\" />；制造业实现利润总额8100亿元，增长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1baf383620261b64.png\" />；电力、热力、燃气及水生产和供应业实现利润总额711.1亿元，增长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-de2f5687a8e63f54.png\" />。</p>","qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"2452877","tag":"综合","type":"single","stem":"2017年1-2月份全国规模以上工业企业实现利润总额：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"8493亿元"},{"k":"B","t":"8576亿元"},{"k":"C","t":"8345亿元"},{"k":"D","t":"8129亿元"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>题干所求为“2017年1-2月份······实现利润总额······”，结合材料所给时间为2018年1-2月份，判定本题为基期计算问题。定位文字材料“2018年1-2月份，全国规模以上工业企业实现利润总额9689亿元，同比增长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7bbe4b7a171a99e5.png\" />”，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-36176cffc301106d.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7ae852b6c124e763.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2d4654acad2a1af1.png\" />，直除首数为83，C项最为接近。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"2452878","tag":"增长","type":"single","stem":"2018年1-2月份股份制企业实现利润总额比上年同期增长约：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"864亿元"},{"k":"B","t":"1434亿元"},{"k":"C","t":"666亿元"},{"k":"D","t":"1185亿元"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>题干所求为“······比上年同期增长······亿元”，判定本题为增长量计算问题。定位文字材料“股份制企业实现利润总额6829.5亿元，增长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c56b990164598be8.png\" />”，则增长量<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e386d7e32e869a8b.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0c793ae1bc0b6efa.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-885012d41faeff96.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E